# Weather Forecast App

A modern weather forecast web application built using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, and Express.

The app fetches real-time weather and 5-day forecast data using the OpenWeather API and dynamically changes background videos based on weather conditions.
---
## Features

- Real-time weather information
- 5-day weather forecast chart
- Dynamic weather-based background videos
- Secure API key handling using backend `.env`
- Responsive UI
- Weather condition videos hosted on Cloudinary
- Chart visualization using Chart.js
---
## Tech Stack
### Frontend
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Chart.js

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js
- dotenv
- cors
### APIs & Services
- OpenWeather API
- Cloudinary CDN
